5
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,260
Become a portable battery for consumable telepaths

6
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:24,260
Except for the thousands of corpses it dissected, there was no similar tissue at all.

7
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:26,060
