I hope to get more zombie corpses for research

11
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,860
If we could produce batteries like this

12
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,260
Saturation strike of telekinetic formation

13
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,660
Will completely break the upper limit of combat power

14
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,860
In addition to supplementary consumption

15
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:42,860
The positional energy in this golden river must be fully realized as soon as possible.
